  "feed": {
    "uid": "2079418676987935483",
    "ciphertext": "~022079418676987935483",
    "title": "Google ranking and lead generation",
    "description": "About the role-\nWe are looking for a results-driven SEO and lead generation specialist to help local businesses improve their Google visibility, attract more qualified customers, and generate consistent enquiries. This is an account management role\n\nYou will be responsible for developing and implementing strategies to improve search rankings, optimise online presence, and increase organic leads through Google.\n\nKey responsibilities-\n- Audit websites and Google Business Profiles to identify ranking opportunities\n- <span class=\"highlight\">Develop</span> local SEO strategies to improve visibility for high-intent searches (e.g. “service near me”)\n- Optimise Google Business Profiles, including categories, services, posts, reviews, and local relevance signals\n- Conduct keyword research and competitor analysis\n- Identify opportunities to improve website content, structure, and on-page SEO\n- Create recommendations for location pages, blogs, and SEO content strategies\n- Track rankings, website traffic, and lead generation performance\n- Provide monthly insights and reporting on SEO progress\n- Identify ways to increase calls, enquiries, and conversions from Google\n\nRequirements-\n- Proven experience improving Google rankings for local businesses\n- Strong understanding of Local SEO and Google - Business Profile optimisation\n- Experience with keyword research and competitor analysis tools\n- Understanding of on-page SEO, technical SEO, and content optimisation\n- Ability to translate SEO data into clear business recommendations\n- Experience generating leads for service-based businesses is highly desirable\n- Experience with Wix (or similar website platforms such as WordPress, <span class=\"highlight\">Shopify</span>, Squarespace) is preferred, with the ability to make basic website updates for SEO and conversion optimisation. Adding blog pages, website landing pages optimisation, ability to action website audit recommendations.\n- Canva / Graphic Design experience for creatives preferred\n\nIdeal experience-\nExperience working with industries such as:\nPest control\nTrades and home services\nBeauty and wellness\n\nSuccess metrics-\n- Improved Google search visibility\n- Increased organic traffic\n- Higher Google Business Profile engagement\n- More phone calls, enquiries, and qualified leads\n- Lower cost per lead (paid ads)\n- Website performance\n\nTo apply, please include:\n- Weekly or monthly reporting examples or template\n- Weekly or monthly strategy reporting examples or template\n- Before/after ranking improvements\n- Your approach to generating leads through SEO\n- Tools you typically use\n- Do you connect and work out of wix account or separately\n\nPlease tell me your rate for monthly ongoing role (this is a proposed monthly deliverable and I welcome any suggestions):\n- Monthly SEO optimisation\n- Google Business Profile updates\n- Keyword tracking\n- 2 SEO blogs/week (8/month)\n- Website improvements\n- Monthly reporting\n- Ad optimisation\n- Ad creatives and copy\n- Meta ads",
